1
00:00:08,630 --> 00:00:10,177
What's wrong, Jiro?

2
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,850
Another fight, hun?

3
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:13,430
Well...

4
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,560
The guys were
makin' fun of me again.

5
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:22,480
- NACHI

6
00:00:16,270 --> 00:00:18,557
- Said I was some
weirdo animal whisperer.

7
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,977
- That I was "different."

8
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:21,227
- Oh, sweetie...

9
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:22,287
- I know it's not easy.

10
00:00:22,370 --> 00:00:23,520
- I know it's not easy.

11
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,190
But you know, Jiro...

12
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:28,820
Being different is actually
a beautiful thing.

13
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:36,740
- NACHI

14
00:00:30,490 --> 00:00:31,320
- Why?

15
00:00:31,410 --> 00:00:36,370
- It means you have talents
unique only to you.

16
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Well, I don't get it.

17
00:00:42,290 --> 00:00:45,090
You'll understand
one day, I promise!

18
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:23,350
- #1 THE FUTURE IS IN OUR HANDS

19
00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:23,097
- Hey, you got any idea
who you're messing with?

20
00:02:23,180 --> 00:02:23,807
- Hey, you got any idea
who you're messing with?

21
00:02:23,890 --> 00:02:26,227
Our sempai's head
of the Demon League!

22
00:02:26,310 --> 00:02:28,310
We control every inch
of this place!

23
00:02:29,110 --> 00:02:30,570
And why should I care?

24
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:33,567
You're just a little prick
hiding behind a big prick,

25
00:02:33,650 --> 00:02:34,697
a good-for-nothin' poser.

26
00:02:34,780 --> 00:02:36,070
What did you—?!

27
00:02:36,570 --> 00:02:38,237
You little—!
Damn!

28
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:41,037
Shit talking punk!

29
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,327
Wh—? He...

30
00:02:42,410 --> 00:02:43,410
Made ya look!

31
00:02:46,170 --> 00:02:48,250
It's called
Utsusemi, got it, jackass?

32
00:02:48,420 --> 00:02:50,670
Now just chill the hell out.

33
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:52,840
Wh-Who is this freak?

34
00:02:53,010 --> 00:02:54,170
Some kinda ninja!

35
00:02:54,380 --> 00:02:55,880
Now what's wrong?

36
00:02:56,050 --> 00:02:58,600
You both can have a taste,
if you want it that bad.

37
00:02:59,890 --> 00:03:03,060
Pathetic wannabe punks!

38
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,440
The hell you think you are?

39
00:03:12,070 --> 00:03:12,897
Hmph...

40
00:03:12,980 --> 00:03:14,570
Waste of time goons.

41
00:03:14,820 --> 00:03:17,570
Phew, you really saved us!

42
00:03:19,410 --> 00:03:21,080
We owe ya one, Jiro!

43
00:03:21,530 --> 00:03:24,370
They've been
really terrorizing us lately!

44
00:03:24,830 --> 00:03:27,330
At least now
those guys'll leave us alone.

45
00:03:27,750 --> 00:03:29,630
But it's you I'm
worried about, Jiro.

46
00:03:29,830 --> 00:03:32,500
They're gonna be
really mad at you now.

47
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:34,090
Eh, don't worry!

48
00:03:34,510 --> 00:03:36,300
I'm way used to it now.

49
00:03:36,590 --> 00:03:37,880
It's that look ya give...

50
00:03:37,970 --> 00:03:40,600
You just rub people
the wrong way, Jiro!

51
00:03:40,890 --> 00:03:41,847
Shuddup!

52
00:03:41,930 --> 00:03:43,100
Wanna be yakitori?

53
00:03:44,850 --> 00:03:46,477
Right, catch ya later!

54
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:49,600
And try to keep
your noses outta the trash, okay?

55
00:03:50,020 --> 00:03:52,110
-See ya!
-See ya!

56
00:03:53,070 --> 00:03:54,067
Dammit!

57
00:03:54,150 --> 00:03:55,610
You've got shit for brains!

58
00:03:55,860 --> 00:03:56,740
Jiro!

59
00:03:56,860 --> 00:03:59,110
You got in another fight,
didn't you?

60
00:03:59,570 --> 00:04:02,240
How many times
do I have to tell you?!

61
00:04:02,450 --> 00:04:04,910
I didn't teach you
the art of the shinobi

62
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:07,120
so you could
act like some punk!

63
00:04:07,290 --> 00:04:08,127
Shut up!

64
00:04:08,210 --> 00:04:09,667
And what good
is shinobi anyhow?

65
00:04:09,750 --> 00:04:11,900
-You're just a dinosaur—
-Watch your mouth!

66
00:04:13,460 --> 00:04:14,670
Okay, Jiro...

67
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:17,757
This is the Azuma family heirloom.

68
00:04:17,840 --> 00:04:19,427
Our venerable shinobigatana!

69
00:04:19,510 --> 00:04:20,507
It was the Edo period when

70
00:04:20,590 --> 00:04:22,717
your ancestors received,
from the shogun himself,

71
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:24,930
this ancient and honorable blade.

72
00:04:25,220 --> 00:04:28,140
Now respect your roots
and act like a true Azuma!

73
00:04:28,310 --> 00:04:29,690
Ungrateful idiot!

74
00:04:31,230 --> 00:04:33,310
Yeah right...
I bet it's a harmless fake.

75
00:04:34,570 --> 00:04:35,690
Fine then.

76
00:04:36,190 --> 00:04:38,650
So you think it is a fake...

77
00:04:40,780 --> 00:04:43,120
See how dull it feels
against your flesh!

78
00:04:44,660 --> 00:04:47,120
Leave me alone!

79
00:04:48,580 --> 00:04:49,457
Sheesh.

80
00:04:49,540 --> 00:04:50,960
The old man really lost it.

81
00:04:51,210 --> 00:04:52,457
Crazy fossil.

82
00:04:52,540 --> 00:04:54,210
Hey, Jiro!

83
00:04:54,380 --> 00:04:55,210
Huh?

84
00:04:55,550 --> 00:04:57,547
Tonight's the
town association meeting.

85
00:04:57,630 --> 00:04:59,970
I won't be back till late.

86
00:05:00,220 --> 00:05:02,140
Now don't forget to lock up.

87
00:05:02,260 --> 00:05:03,970
Shut it, old man!

88
00:05:04,510 --> 00:05:05,307
Hmph...

89
00:05:05,390 --> 00:05:07,137
Don't forget to lock up, my ass.

90
00:05:07,220 --> 00:05:09,147
Who's he think I am,
some elementary school kid?

91
00:05:09,230 --> 00:05:10,480
Hey Jiro!

92
00:05:11,100 --> 00:05:12,480
Who is it now?

93
00:05:13,150 --> 00:05:14,650
Oh, hey, I remember you.

94
00:05:14,940 --> 00:05:15,770
What's up?

95
00:05:15,860 --> 00:05:17,510
A cat's in trouble,
in the woods!

96
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:19,490
A cat?

97
00:05:22,070 --> 00:05:24,240
Hey, we're you taking me?

98
00:05:25,070 --> 00:05:25,867
There!

99
00:05:25,950 --> 00:05:27,240
He's over there!

100
00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:30,790
Holy...

101
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,150
What the hell happened?

102
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:33,830
You know him?

103
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:35,750
No, never seen him.

104
00:05:36,250 --> 00:05:38,627
I think he might still be alive,

105
00:05:38,710 --> 00:05:41,260
but my squawks get no response!

106
00:05:41,510 --> 00:05:42,507
Crap...

107
00:05:42,590 --> 00:05:44,260
The little guy's really hurt.

108
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:46,550
I gotta do something!

109
00:05:46,890 --> 00:05:47,677
Hey!

110
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:48,680
Hear me?

111
00:05:48,850 --> 00:05:50,810
-Hey! Hey!
-Who's there?

112
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:53,310
Who dares call upon me?

113
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:56,900
Rago...

114
00:05:57,110 --> 00:06:00,030
Oh Black Star of Doom,
devourer of the sun...

115
00:06:00,650 --> 00:06:04,280
Awaken from your slumber,
and lend us your might.

116
00:06:04,780 --> 00:06:06,320
Piss the hell off!

117
00:06:06,530 --> 00:06:08,867
You'll wish you never
disrupted my nap.

118
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:11,960
I take orders from no one, got it?

119
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,500
I see...

120
00:06:13,710 --> 00:06:16,960
'Tis a pity indeed...

121
00:06:17,420 --> 00:06:20,130
Then here it is where
you shall expire!

122
00:06:33,270 --> 00:06:35,310
Oh! There're those peepers!

123
00:06:35,940 --> 00:06:37,770
You've gotta be thirsty!

124
00:06:38,190 --> 00:06:39,567
You were pretty beat up,

125
00:06:39,650 --> 00:06:41,690
I didn't think you'd make it.

126
00:06:41,990 --> 00:06:44,570
But you're a tough little guy!

127
00:06:45,070 --> 00:06:46,277
I'm Jiro.

128
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:48,280
And you are?

129
00:06:49,530 --> 00:06:50,660
Come on!

130
00:06:50,790 --> 00:06:52,830
Even strays got names.

131
00:06:53,870 --> 00:06:55,290
I'm dealin' with an idiot.

132
00:06:55,750 --> 00:06:57,710
Like you'd understand
if I told you!

133
00:06:58,250 --> 00:06:59,297
I'm an idiot, eh?

134
00:06:59,380 --> 00:07:01,840
I'll kick that furry little ass!

135
00:07:03,590 --> 00:07:04,420
Hey...

136
00:07:04,590 --> 00:07:06,680
Don't be such a scaredy-cat!

137
00:07:09,100 --> 00:07:11,760
Look, this's your
first conversation with a human.

138
00:07:11,850 --> 00:07:14,060
I know it's a lot to take in.

139
00:07:14,390 --> 00:07:15,807
It's not like I'm gonna eat you!

140
00:07:15,890 --> 00:07:16,850
Come out!

141
00:07:17,190 --> 00:07:19,067
I'm not picking up
any spectral energy.

142
00:07:19,150 --> 00:07:20,940
He's human, no doubt 'bout it.

143
00:07:21,150 --> 00:07:22,197
Then he must be...

144
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,110
No.

145
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:24,197
Tsk...

146
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:25,950
That's too bad.

147
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:27,620
Time for my secret weapon.

148
00:07:28,530 --> 00:07:31,120
You're not prying
me outta here with a crowbar.

149
00:07:35,540 --> 00:07:36,830
Well, that was easy!

150
00:07:40,590 --> 00:07:41,877
You know what they say...

151
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:44,010
The way to a man's heart is
through his stomach.

152
00:07:44,260 --> 00:07:45,130
Huh?!

153
00:07:45,630 --> 00:07:48,380
Funny, a cat
who thinks he's a man.

154
00:07:48,630 --> 00:07:50,140
I am not a cat!

155
00:07:50,300 --> 00:07:51,890
What do you mean?

156
00:07:54,470 --> 00:07:56,180
The name's Rago.

157
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:58,390
I'm an immortal...

158
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,900
A mononoke.

159
00:08:00,270 --> 00:08:02,650
A mononoke?

160
00:08:02,980 --> 00:08:04,900
People've got
loads of names for 'em.

161
00:08:05,070 --> 00:08:07,650
All you've gotta know
is they're out there.

162
00:08:07,990 --> 00:08:09,280
Perfect...

163
00:08:09,450 --> 00:08:11,660
I think I can get him to confess.

164
00:08:12,660 --> 00:08:15,540
Most of the time we'll
take human or animal form,

165
00:08:15,700 --> 00:08:18,290
and the world is none the wiser.

166
00:08:18,580 --> 00:08:19,830
And some of us...

167
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:22,920
live up in the mountains
or deep in the woods in solitude.

168
00:08:23,170 --> 00:08:24,170
Huh...

169
00:08:24,630 --> 00:08:25,460
And?

170
00:08:25,670 --> 00:08:29,430
How'd a mononoke
like you end up like this?

171
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:32,100
So he isn't bluffing...

172
00:08:32,510 --> 00:08:35,180
He really doesn't have a clue.

173
00:08:35,430 --> 00:08:36,350
What?

174
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:38,020
That like off limits?

175
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:39,937
I was attacked...

176
00:08:40,020 --> 00:08:41,350
By another mononoke.

177
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,560
What happened?

178
00:08:42,980 --> 00:08:44,237
Some kind of argument?

179
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:46,860
I don't remember much about it.

180
00:08:47,190 --> 00:08:49,820
I'd been deep
asleep, and for a long time.

181
00:08:50,150 --> 00:08:53,030
Next thing I knew
I'd been woken up.

182
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:56,200
The sneaky little bastards
had me surrounded.

183
00:08:57,120 --> 00:09:01,040
They demanded my assistance.

184
00:09:01,580 --> 00:09:04,087
I told 'em I wasn't interested,
to get lost...

185
00:09:04,170 --> 00:09:05,800
Ahh, now I get it...

186
00:09:06,050 --> 00:09:07,960
So then they
ganged up on you.

187
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:10,550
But why'd you turn 'em down?

188
00:09:10,930 --> 00:09:12,680
They're mononoke like you, right?

189
00:09:13,180 --> 00:09:15,220
'Cause I freakin' hate guys like that...

190
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:17,477
Parasites acting like big shots,

191
00:09:17,560 --> 00:09:20,160
hiding their weakness
behind the strength of others.

192
00:09:21,390 --> 00:09:23,900
What does it matter anyway?

193
00:09:24,190 --> 00:09:27,860
You're a human, you don't believe
a word I'm saying.

194
00:09:28,610 --> 00:09:30,150
Well, to be honest...

195
00:09:30,530 --> 00:09:33,160
None of it makes much sense to me.

196
00:09:33,780 --> 00:09:36,740
But that doesn't mean
I don't believe you!

197
00:09:37,950 --> 00:09:40,460
Guess you forgot
I can talk to animals!

198
00:09:41,460 --> 00:09:43,880
Why would I freak
out 'bout some mononoke?

199
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:48,167
You're one helluva weirdo.

200
00:09:48,250 --> 00:09:49,760
Hey, watch it!

201
00:09:51,760 --> 00:09:53,340
Kishimojin
reporting to headquarters...

202
00:09:53,590 --> 00:09:54,760
Chief, do you read me?

203
00:09:55,140 --> 00:09:56,017
Shiba here.

204
00:09:56,100 --> 00:09:57,260
Find anything?

205
00:09:57,560 --> 00:09:58,510
Yes...

206
00:09:58,970 --> 00:10:01,097
I'm at coordinates E-16,
in the woods.

207
00:10:01,180 --> 00:10:02,560
I've found blood.

208
00:10:02,890 --> 00:10:03,897
I'm absolutely certain.

209
00:10:03,980 --> 00:10:05,150
It's Rago's.

210
00:10:05,310 --> 00:10:07,060
I'm picking up
one type of spectral energy,

211
00:10:07,150 --> 00:10:08,400
and it stops right here.

212
00:10:08,900 --> 00:10:11,110
He might still be nearby.

213
00:10:11,530 --> 00:10:12,317
All right.

214
00:10:12,400 --> 00:10:14,570
I'll regroup with the search team.

215
00:10:14,820 --> 00:10:16,030
Pull back for now.

216
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:17,330
Got it.

217
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:21,750
Not like I couldn't
handle this on my own...

218
00:10:29,050 --> 00:10:30,670
Woah, crazy!

219
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:33,050
You're already healed up!

220
00:10:33,590 --> 00:10:36,550
You really are no
ordinary cat, are ya?

221
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:37,800
I knew it...

222
00:10:37,930 --> 00:10:40,060
You didn't believe a word I said.

223
00:10:40,470 --> 00:10:42,680
Well, half of it.

224
00:10:42,850 --> 00:10:45,440
The rest I thought was just crazy
talk by a cat on death's door.

225
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:46,560
You little—!

226
00:10:46,940 --> 00:10:48,770
Ah, you know...

227
00:10:49,150 --> 00:10:51,400
This really reminds
me of those times with Nachi.

228
00:10:51,570 --> 00:10:52,570
Nachi?

229
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:53,527
Yeah, my old dog.

230
00:10:53,610 --> 00:10:55,450
- Yeah, my old dog.

231
00:10:53,780 --> 00:10:57,740
- NACHI

232
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:57,570
- She was the biggest, fluffiest,

233
00:10:57,700 --> 00:11:00,160
- most caring dog
a guy could ask for.

234
00:11:00,700 --> 00:11:03,250
Come to think of it,
kinda the exact opposite of you.

235
00:11:03,370 --> 00:11:05,160
I'll kill you, punk kid!

236
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:08,960
Back then,
I got bullied all the time.

237
00:11:09,380 --> 00:11:12,340
I'd come home covered in mud,
cuts, and scrapes.

238
00:11:13,010 --> 00:11:16,720
Nachi'd take one look at me
and ask me to give her a bath.

239
00:11:17,260 --> 00:11:19,097
She'd say, "you scrub my fur,
and I'll make sure

240
00:11:19,180 --> 00:11:22,930
all the yuckiness from your day
goes down the drain, too."

241
00:11:23,140 --> 00:11:24,600
Then she'd always say,

242
00:11:24,890 --> 00:11:26,940
"I'm so lucky to have you, Jiro."

243
00:11:27,190 --> 00:11:30,490
"Who else gets to have their owner
bathe them whenever they want?"

244
00:11:30,980 --> 00:11:32,630
"You've got the gift of helping."

245
00:11:33,650 --> 00:11:36,450
"Make sure you share
that gift with others too."

246
00:11:37,570 --> 00:11:42,950
"It's your unique gift," she'd say.

247
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:46,750
-Hey...
-Okay, time to rinse!

248
00:11:54,880 --> 00:11:56,840
I'm sorry, kid.

249
00:11:57,010 --> 00:11:58,840
I really owe you one.

250
00:11:58,970 --> 00:12:00,470
But I've gotta go.

251
00:12:01,970 --> 00:12:03,100
So long.

252
00:12:06,100 --> 00:12:08,390
Damn...
My wounds've healed,

253
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:10,770
but my strength isn't
what it used to be.

254
00:12:10,940 --> 00:12:12,940
I've gotta get away
from this place.

255
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:15,900
Hey, looking a little
unsteady there.

256
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:18,950
Hey, when did you...?

257
00:12:19,070 --> 00:12:20,907
Wanna keep it down?

258
00:12:20,990 --> 00:12:23,120
It's the middle of the night.

259
00:12:23,700 --> 00:12:25,700
But you were sound asleep!

260
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,370
That was my Kawarimi.

261
00:12:27,460 --> 00:12:29,960
What? Of all the cheap tricks...

262
00:12:30,170 --> 00:12:31,710
Forget that...

263
00:12:32,130 --> 00:12:34,630
Where do you think
you're going in that condition?

264
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:38,970
Where I go is none of your concern.

265
00:12:39,220 --> 00:12:41,260
None of my concern?

266
00:12:41,550 --> 00:12:43,650
Remember, I'm the one
who saved your life!

267
00:12:44,890 --> 00:12:47,980
I don't remember
asking you for any help.

268
00:12:48,520 --> 00:12:50,100
Whadja just say?

269
00:12:50,190 --> 00:12:52,147
You helped me
because you wanted to,

270
00:12:52,230 --> 00:12:54,110
so you can cut the savior act.

271
00:12:54,610 --> 00:12:59,150
Besides, I would've been just fine
with dying back there.

272
00:12:59,530 --> 00:13:00,360
Huh?

273
00:13:00,570 --> 00:13:02,020
What's that
supposed to mean?

274
00:13:02,530 --> 00:13:06,620
Like I said,
it's none of your business.

275
00:13:06,990 --> 00:13:09,370
All right,
you can cut it out now, okay!

276
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:12,120
I don't know what your story is,

277
00:13:12,210 --> 00:13:14,060
but don't ever
talk 'bout dying like—

278
00:13:15,590 --> 00:13:17,880
You don't know when to shut up.

279
00:13:18,260 --> 00:13:19,837
Keep yammering,

280
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:21,630
and I'll turn your windpipe

281
00:13:21,800 --> 00:13:25,010
into my personal
scratching post, kid.

282
00:13:26,140 --> 00:13:28,640
I know your memory's
not that short.

283
00:13:28,930 --> 00:13:30,520
I'm a mononoke!

284
00:13:30,890 --> 00:13:33,060
A human-eating specter!

285
00:13:33,400 --> 00:13:36,770
You and I come from
completely different worlds!

286
00:13:37,230 --> 00:13:40,030
Do me a favor,
and leave me the hell alone!

287
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:43,910
Looks like you two are
enjoying yourselves.

288
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:46,200
Mind if I join ya?

289
00:13:46,620 --> 00:13:47,657
You don't mind...

290
00:13:47,740 --> 00:13:50,410
Right, Rago?

291
00:13:50,790 --> 00:13:51,790
Crap...

292
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:53,920
They're after me already.

293
00:13:54,420 --> 00:13:55,790
Hey, douchebag!

294
00:13:56,250 --> 00:13:58,920
You always turn up at people's
houses uninvited?

295
00:13:59,590 --> 00:14:01,380
Look, I don't know who you are,

296
00:14:01,470 --> 00:14:03,270
but I'm pretty pissed off right now.

297
00:14:04,220 --> 00:14:05,300
That means piss off.

298
00:14:06,970 --> 00:14:09,140
Heh! Relax, human.

299
00:14:10,020 --> 00:14:11,770
I'll devour you in no time!

300
00:14:17,770 --> 00:14:18,820
Not so fast!

301
00:14:24,410 --> 00:14:29,330
You and I come from
completely different worlds!

302
00:14:29,660 --> 00:14:32,080
Do me a favor,
and leave me the hell alone!

303
00:14:43,300 --> 00:14:44,590
What's wrong?

304
00:14:44,970 --> 00:14:47,340
It's almost like
you want me to catch you!

305
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:49,100
You bastard!

306
00:14:49,430 --> 00:14:50,970
I don't have
to get away completely.

307
00:14:51,140 --> 00:14:53,850
All I need is a
little distance between us!

308
00:14:54,890 --> 00:14:56,350
I must say...

309
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:59,060
I'd heard you were
in bad shape...

310
00:14:59,150 --> 00:15:01,030
But I never expected this.

311
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:06,320
Tag, you're it.

312
00:15:08,740 --> 00:15:10,160
Utterly pathetic!

313
00:15:12,750 --> 00:15:16,080
So this is the "legendary" mononoke...

314
00:15:16,290 --> 00:15:19,210
Rago, the Black Star of Doom.

315
00:15:21,130 --> 00:15:23,337
All right, no more talking.

316
00:15:23,420 --> 00:15:24,677
You're coming with me.

317
00:15:24,760 --> 00:15:27,130
You should know
we worked very hard to break

318
00:15:27,220 --> 00:15:29,180
the seal that imprisoned you.

319
00:15:29,430 --> 00:15:32,720
And I would prefer not
to have to kill a fellow comrade.

320
00:15:33,020 --> 00:15:34,480
Comrade?

321
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:36,140
Don't make me laugh!

322
00:15:36,390 --> 00:15:39,480
All you fools
care about is getting my power.

323
00:15:39,650 --> 00:15:43,230
If you want it that bad,
then come and get it!

324
00:15:43,650 --> 00:15:47,240
But only if you're prepared
to meet your death!

325
00:15:48,490 --> 00:15:49,740
That so?

326
00:15:49,990 --> 00:15:51,990
The only one meeting death is you!

327
00:16:09,470 --> 00:16:11,050
K-Kid?!

328
00:16:12,220 --> 00:16:14,220
You fool!
Why—?!

329
00:16:14,310 --> 00:16:16,350
You're the fool, dumbass!

330
00:16:17,060 --> 00:16:18,560
If you bite the dust,

331
00:16:18,770 --> 00:16:21,110
then I saved you
for nothing, jerk-off!

332
00:16:21,650 --> 00:16:22,480
What...?

333
00:16:22,820 --> 00:16:26,240
You idiot,
you're in way over your head!

334
00:16:26,570 --> 00:16:28,610
This isn't
some little street scuffle!

335
00:16:29,950 --> 00:16:32,120
You really know
how to piss a guy off!

336
00:16:34,450 --> 00:16:36,330
Saving someone...

337
00:16:37,040 --> 00:16:38,750
...is never stupid, got it?

338
00:16:39,420 --> 00:16:41,460
And when I help someone,
I help them!

339
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:44,250
I don't do it half-assed, got it?

340
00:16:44,550 --> 00:16:46,010
Besides...

341
00:16:46,510 --> 00:16:48,087
Even if I got away,

342
00:16:48,170 --> 00:16:50,220
he'd come after me
after he got you.

343
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:53,510
You're smarter
than you look, human!

344
00:16:55,760 --> 00:16:57,930
But you're a peculiar one.

345
00:16:58,140 --> 00:17:01,270
My form doesn't seem to faze you
in the slightest.

346
00:17:01,850 --> 00:17:04,980
And that swordsmanship,
that stealth...

347
00:17:05,440 --> 00:17:08,900
Do I sense a boy of shinobi stock?

348
00:17:10,820 --> 00:17:12,407
I'm gonna enjoy...

349
00:17:12,490 --> 00:17:13,867
...wolfing you down!

350
00:17:13,950 --> 00:17:14,780
Kid!

351
00:17:16,450 --> 00:17:17,747
Th-That's...!

352
00:17:17,830 --> 00:17:18,910
Utsusemi!

353
00:17:20,540 --> 00:17:21,370
He's...

354
00:17:23,080 --> 00:17:24,630
Oopsie!

355
00:17:24,960 --> 00:17:27,377
Looks like someone
got a little too excited

356
00:17:27,460 --> 00:17:29,170
with their fancy ninja moves.

357
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:32,260
Just let go.

358
00:17:32,380 --> 00:17:35,640
Resisting will only make it worse.

359
00:17:37,100 --> 00:17:38,220
Whoa!

360
00:17:38,600 --> 00:17:40,850
That was close!

361
00:17:41,140 --> 00:17:44,900
An excellent counter
from a true shinobi!

362
00:17:45,110 --> 00:17:46,360
I applaud thee.

363
00:17:47,110 --> 00:17:49,820
Hmm?
The darkness closing in already?

364
00:17:50,280 --> 00:17:51,110
Huh?

365
00:17:55,700 --> 00:17:57,327
Of course, Rago!

366
00:17:57,410 --> 00:17:59,200
I'll just give him to you!

367
00:17:59,500 --> 00:18:02,000
It's been a while
since your last meal, no?

368
00:18:02,620 --> 00:18:04,920
I'm sure a full belly...

369
00:18:05,130 --> 00:18:06,630
-will change your—
-Enough!

370
00:18:07,460 --> 00:18:08,380
Shut your trap!

371
00:18:08,750 --> 00:18:10,130
You're dead.

372
00:18:13,840 --> 00:18:15,430
Selfish brat.

373
00:18:15,760 --> 00:18:19,350
Doesn't even cross your mind that
I up and left for your benefit.

374
00:18:19,850 --> 00:18:24,140
Then you ignore me when
I warned you to stay out of things.

375
00:18:24,600 --> 00:18:26,770
And if you die,

376
00:18:26,980 --> 00:18:30,650
all of this really will
be for nothing, you idiot.

377
00:18:31,530 --> 00:18:35,240
I could eat you
and get back to my old self.

378
00:18:35,530 --> 00:18:36,950
But, no, I won't.

379
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:40,010
I refuse to take orders from
that annoying halfwit demon.

380
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:42,580
That's why instead...

381
00:18:42,870 --> 00:18:44,790
You're gonna eat me.

382
00:18:45,870 --> 00:18:48,000
I owe you one.

383
00:18:48,130 --> 00:18:50,667
And I'm gonna return the favor now.

384
00:18:50,750 --> 00:18:53,170
Stop, Rago! Why you—!
What are you—?!

385
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:57,800
I take this life,
and give it to you!

386
00:18:58,800 --> 00:19:00,470
Open your eyes,

387
00:19:00,810 --> 00:19:02,430
Jiro!

388
00:19:05,060 --> 00:19:05,977
Chief?!

389
00:19:06,060 --> 00:19:07,440
It's over here as well.

390
00:19:07,900 --> 00:19:10,190
Seems things have
gotten a little messy.

391
00:19:10,570 --> 00:19:12,940
All hands, proceed to location!

392
00:19:13,030 --> 00:19:15,740
D-Damn you, Rago!

393
00:19:16,030 --> 00:19:19,160
Do you realize what you've done?!

394
00:19:19,830 --> 00:19:23,700
Handing over power to
a human, a shinobi...!

395
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:29,040
You abandoned
your fellow mononoke for a human?!

396
00:19:30,420 --> 00:19:32,210
Jeez, you're loud.

397
00:19:34,300 --> 00:19:36,470
What's happening, crap...

398
00:19:37,180 --> 00:19:40,097
Wait, what is this?!

399
00:19:40,180 --> 00:19:42,727
All right, you can pick your jaw
off the floor now, kid!

400
00:19:42,810 --> 00:19:43,640
Rago?!

401
00:19:44,060 --> 00:19:45,557
Hey, what the hell's going on?

402
00:19:45,640 --> 00:19:46,600
I'll explain later!

403
00:19:46,690 --> 00:19:47,477
Watch out!

404
00:19:47,560 --> 00:19:49,437
You two are living on
borrowed time!

405
00:19:49,520 --> 00:19:51,610
You fused fools are mine!

406
00:19:51,980 --> 00:19:53,940
Hey...
What does he mean fused?!

407
00:19:54,030 --> 00:19:55,317
Priorities, kid!

408
00:19:55,400 --> 00:19:58,070
We gotta kill this bastard first!

409
00:20:00,660 --> 00:20:01,830
Kill him?

410
00:20:02,200 --> 00:20:03,950
How do you expect me to do that?

411
00:20:04,370 --> 00:20:05,580
Don't worry.

412
00:20:05,750 --> 00:20:07,330
I'll give you a hand!

413
00:20:15,130 --> 00:20:18,220
All you gotta do is
make a fist...

414
00:20:19,840 --> 00:20:21,720
And send the piece of shit to hell!

415
00:20:28,270 --> 00:20:30,230
You'll give me a hand...

416
00:20:33,520 --> 00:20:35,150
Is this what you meant?

417
00:20:39,610 --> 00:20:40,570
Crap...

418
00:20:40,740 --> 00:20:42,530
What's going on?

419
00:20:42,950 --> 00:20:45,410
Hey, tell me
what the hell's going on!

420
00:20:45,660 --> 00:20:47,080
Rago?

421
00:20:47,580 --> 00:20:48,430
Stay right there.

422
00:20:48,620 --> 00:20:49,750
Not a word.

423
00:20:50,080 --> 00:20:51,000
What the?

424
00:20:51,290 --> 00:20:52,460
Who is this chick?

425
00:20:52,580 --> 00:20:53,500
When did she—?!

426
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:58,510
Well, I'll be...
This is quite the pickle.

427
00:21:01,930 --> 00:21:04,847
I never expected this to happen.

428
00:21:04,930 --> 00:21:08,350
Shit... You're not with
that giant, are you?

429
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:12,860
Hey, no need to be rude...

430
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:15,440
We're no mononoke.

431
00:21:16,530 --> 00:21:18,780
We're from the Bureau of Espionage...

432
00:21:18,900 --> 00:21:21,610
Just your average civil servants.

433
00:21:21,990 --> 00:21:24,280
Bureau... of Espionage?

434
00:21:24,530 --> 00:21:27,120
I'll fill you in
on the details later.

435
00:21:27,870 --> 00:21:31,790
As you may have already surmised,
young man,

436
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:34,500
we are taking you into custody.

437
00:21:34,840 --> 00:21:35,627
Huh?!

438
00:21:35,710 --> 00:21:37,130
Are you kidding me?

439
00:21:37,250 --> 00:21:39,350
You can't just show up
out of nowhere and—

440
00:21:40,260 --> 00:21:41,550
I told you...

441
00:21:42,090 --> 00:21:43,550
Not a word.

442
00:21:43,970 --> 00:21:47,220
Hey, Ichika, take it easy.

443
00:21:47,470 --> 00:21:49,520
It's only temporary.

444
00:21:49,850 --> 00:21:52,310
We don't want him confused
and aggressive.

445
00:21:52,690 --> 00:21:55,810
Ever the dutiful agent, I must say.

446
00:21:56,690 --> 00:21:59,320
So what are we
going to do with him?

447
00:21:59,820 --> 00:22:03,270
For now, get 'em to our affiliate
hospital for treatment and testing.

448
00:22:03,660 --> 00:22:05,570
We can't afford to
have him die on us.

449
00:22:06,200 --> 00:22:09,240
He's very important.

450
00:22:09,490 --> 00:22:10,910
For us...

451
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:12,660
And for the mononoke.
